# 强制 LF 换行：sbatch / shell / python 脚本在 Linux 集群上执行。
# 覆盖 core.autocrlf=true 在 checkout 时把 LF 转成 CRLF 的行为，
# 否则会触发 `sbatch: error: Batch script contains DOS line breaks (\r\n)`。
*.sbatch text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf

# MGF files are provenance-bearing numeric artifacts; newline conversion would
# invalidate their recorded SHA-256 even though the payload is line-oriented.
*.mgf    -text

